  "notes": [
    "Group half-lives are initial activity-slope harmonic means. No explicit daughter ingrowth.",
    "U_actinides has zero represented inventory in this isotope set. This does not establish zero physical uranium activity.",
    "Initial removal rates and control-room factors preserve preceding FLARE screening defaults. The two-stage group extension is not the ANO1 two-region spray model.",
    "Two-stage group spray approximation: initial rate until cumulative spray-only exposure DF50, then one-tenth rate. Clock starts at spray start and is shared across release phases; decay/leakage/natural deposition do not advance it. No terminal DF cap is imposed. Halogens retain the existing group approximation; no separate iodine chemistry is resolved.",
    "Case aerosol-rate override uses legacy spray weights (halogens90% particulate plus existing nonparticulate term). Penetration filtration uses95% particulate halogens, as in accepted ANO sensitivity; elemental and organic iodine share the case iodine filter efficiency. These effective group weights do not resolve chemical populations."
